==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fr|militarisme}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# An [[ideology]] which [[claim]]s that the [[military]] is the [[foundation]] of a [[society]]'s [[security]], and thereby its most [[important]] [[aspect]].
# A [[focus]] on, or [[excessive]] [[use]] of, [[military]] [[force]].

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|anti-militarism}}

